e faster</h2></div></div><a href="<?=e(navurl('products'))?>" class="quick-action"><b>＋</b><span>Add a new product<small>Photos, variants, price, stock</small></span>↗</a><a href="<?=e(navurl('categories'))?>" class="quick-action"><b>▦</b><span>Manage categories<small>Organize your catalogue</small></span>↗</a><a href="<?=e(navurl('coupons'))?>" class="quick-action"><b>%</b><span>Create an offer<small>Percentage or fixed discounts</small></span>↗</a><a href="<?=e(navurl('notifications'))?>" class="quick-action"><b>◉</b><span>Connect notifications<small>Telegram and WhatsApp API</small></span>↗</a><div class="quick-summary"><span>CATALOGUE</span><strong><?=e($catalog['products']??0)?> products</strong> · <?=e(count($cats))?> categories</div></section></div>
